<title>USA: U.S. wheat, corn and barley export inspections.</title>
<headline>U.S. wheat, corn and barley export inspections.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Agriculture Department said the 33.588 million bushels of wheat, 12.106 million of corn and 1.419 million of barley inspected for export in the week ended Sept 5 were for the following shipment from port areas or inland inspection points (1,000 bu).</p>
<p>	     Wheat     Corn	Barley</p>
<p> Lakes     2,326	Nil	  Nil</p>
<p> Atlantic    Nil	Nil	  Nil</p>
<p> Gulf     15,141   11,782	  Nil</p>
<p> Pacific  15,967	290	1,419</p>
<p> Interior    154	 34	  Nil</p>
</text>
